@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Index a document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "company-handbook.md",
  "content": "Employees get 25 vacation days per year. Remote work is allowed up to three days a week. The office is closed on public holidays."
}

### Ask a question (vector search)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How many vacation days do employees get?"
}

### Ask with hybrid search + LLM re-ranking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I work from home?",
  "topK": 3,
  "useHybridSearch": true,
  "useReranking": true
}
